{
 "id": "grid_navigation",
 "version": "1.0.0",
 "depends_on": [
  "navigation_modes"
 ],
 "description": "Graph-native grid nav + exploration + MODE SELECTION. The agent UNDERSTANDS navigation modes (navigation_modes concepts) and ACTIVELY CHOOSES between them by its own shape (winner-take-all): activate_<mode> drive each NavMode's activation from a situation signal (cover_stuck->pocket_escape, frontier_flux->mover_avoid, baseline->frontier_seek); select_mode is the Argmax winner -> game.nav_mode; the mode gates behaviour (select_seek=nearest when seeking, select_escape=farthest when escaping, goal_abandon patient in mover_avoid). Plus the exploration core: mark_visited, cover_tick, goal_abandon+reopen_abandoned (quarantine), release_goal (on reached/abandoned), hop_descend_gradient. Host: measure body, fire slide_flood, wire has_mode, stamp fresh+frontier_flux, clear blocks in pocket_escape, read chosen_action. Every decision is a rule.",
